00:09:16.137 --> 00:09:16.975
- [Narrator] Ohh.

00:09:16.975 --> 00:09:18.350
- Triple-decker cheesecake.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:20.415
- It always feels good
when I'm able to make

00:09:20.415 --> 00:09:23.216
a food, sort of idea or
food dream into reality.

00:09:23.216 --> 00:09:26.247
I like the way people can
smile when you feed them.

00:09:26.247 --> 00:09:28.312
It also took a lot of restraint for me,

00:09:28.312 --> 00:09:31.784
not to play a mix tapes
during the entire process,

00:09:31.784 --> 00:09:32.617
because I knew I had to keep the cake cold

00:09:32.617 --> 00:09:36.450
and if I played, it
would've just melted so...

00:09:36.454 --> 00:09:37.396
- [Brenda] Stop it!

00:09:37.396 --> 00:09:39.351
This is turning into a mix tape joke.

00:09:39.351 --> 00:09:40.460
- Hey Brenda, you wanted final thoughts,

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:42.112
I'm giving you honest thoughts straight

00:09:42.112 --> 00:09:42.945
from the heart.

00:09:42.945 --> 00:09:43.842
(laughing)

00:09:43.842 --> 00:09:46.425
(upbeat music)

